Z||000002||GarethWright||03-06-2001||05:10 PM||||If you go to cycletrader.com and hit the search button, you can search for bikes in your area and price range.  You can specify make, model, year range etc, or leave those blank and just enter the price and your area code.  It will give you a list of bikes for sale, with phone-numbers, and some have pics too.  GL with the hunt.||||reg||1
